# 6. Idempotency Tests

## 6.1 Run Twice Test

```yaml
# tests/idempotency/run_twice.yml
---
- name: Idempotency Test - Run Twice
  hosts: nexus
  become: true
  tasks:
    - name: First run
      ansible.builtin.include_role:
        name: nexus-as-code.nexus_deploy

    - name: Capture first run results
      ansible.builtin.set_fact:
        first_run_changed: "{{ ansible_play_hosts | map('extract', hostvars, 'ansible_facts') | list }}"

    - name: Second run
      ansible.builtin.include_role:
        name: nexus-as-code.nexus_deploy

    - name: Capture second run results
      ansible.builtin.set_fact:
        second_run_changed: "{{ ansible_play_hosts | map('extract', hostvars, 'ansible_facts') | list }}"

    - name: Verify idempotency
      ansible.builtin.debug:
        msg: "Second run should have fewer changes than first run"
```

## 6.2 Check Mode Test

```yaml
# tests/idempotency/check_mode.yml
---
- name: Check Mode Test
  hosts: nexus
  become: true
  tasks:
    - name: Run in check mode
      ansible.builtin.include_role:
        name: nexus-as-code.nexus_deploy
      check_mode: true
      register: check_mode_result

    - name: Verify check mode reported changes
      ansible.builtin.debug:
        msg: "Check mode completed without errors"

    - name: Run actual deployment
      ansible.builtin.include_role:
        name: nexus-as-code.nexus_deploy

    - name: Run in check mode again (should show no changes)
      ansible.builtin.include_role:
        name: nexus-as-code.nexus_deploy
      check_mode: true
      register: check_mode_second

    - name: Verify second check mode shows no changes
      ansible.builtin.debug:
        msg: "Second check mode run should report no changes"
```

