# 15. Test Execution

## Running Tests

```bash
# Run all molecule tests
molecule test

# Run specific scenario
molecule test -s default
molecule test -s upgrade
molecule test -s backup-restore

# Run only verification
molecule verify

# Run only convergence
molecule converge

# Run with debug output
molecule test -s default --debug

# Run specific tag
ansible-playbook tests/integration/full_stack.yml --tags "nexus,repos"
```

## Test Environment Setup

```bash
# Install molecule
pip install molecule molecule-docker ansible-lint yamllint

# Install Ansible collections
ansible-galaxy collection install community.docker
ansible-galaxy collection install community.general
ansible-galaxy collection install ansible.posix

# Run linting
ansible-lint
yamllint roles/*/tasks/*.yml
```

