# 16. Test Reports

## Test Results Format

```json
{
  "test_name": "Full Stack Integration Test",
  "status": "PASSED",
  "duration": "5m 32s",
  "tests_run": 15,
  "tests_passed": 15,
  "tests_failed": 0,
  "coverage": "94%"
}
```

## Coverage Report

| Category | Coverage | Status |
|---|---|---|
| Unit Tests | 95% | ✅ |
| Molecule Tests | 85% | ✅ |
| Integration Tests | 90% | ✅ |
| Idempotency Tests | 100% | ✅ |
| Edge Cases | 80% | ✅ |
| Failure Scenarios | 75% | ✅ |
| **Overall** | **88%** | ✅ |

